Third-Party Data & Attribution Notice:
- NASA-ISRO SAR (NISAR) Level-2 GCOV radar observations are distributed by the
  Alaska Satellite Facility Distributed Active Archive Center (ASF DAAC) / NASA
  Earthdata.
- Sentinel-2 optical validation data contain modified Copernicus Sentinel data
  (2026), accessed via Element 84 Earth Search.
- ERA5 reanalysis weather records are provided via Open-Meteo (CC BY 4.0), and
  VYYY airport METAR observations via the Iowa Environmental Mesonet.
- Basemap tiles and vector data are courtesy of OpenFreeMap, OpenMapTiles, and
  OpenStreetMap contributors.
